3
00:00:04.426 --> 00:00:06.039
How does India keep them

4
00:00:06.039 --> 00:00:06.990
close?

5
00:00:07.321 --> 00:00:08.847
An O-C-I card gives a

6
00:00:08.847 --> 00:00:11.391
