12
00:00:21.692 --> 00:00:23.775
The day Gandhi came back

13
00:00:23.775 --> 00:00:26.093
from South Africa in 1915.

14
00:00:26.093 --> 00:00:27.919
It was first held in

15
00:00:27.919 --> 00:00:28.913
2003.

16
00:00:29.247 --> 00:00:31.801
India receives more remittances than

17
00:00:31.801 --> 00:00:33.401
